language design-core version 0.6.
system SDPTool.
container SdpToolHost.
unit SdlSemanticLibrary.
unit NavigationProjection.
unit DocumentPublisher.
unit ExternalXfmd.
SDPTool contains SdpToolHost.
SdpToolHost contains SdlSemanticLibrary.
SdpToolHost contains NavigationProjection.
SdpToolHost contains DocumentPublisher.
feature ReadableSystemDesign.
feature ProducerOwnedNavigation.
usecase UnderstandSystem.
actor DesignReader.
DesignReader pursues UnderstandSystem.
ReadableSystemDesign supports UnderstandSystem.
ProducerOwnedNavigation supports UnderstandSystem.
mode DesignBrowsing.
interface CheckedSourceGraph.
interface NativeDocumentRendering.
SdlSemanticLibrary consumes CheckedSourceGraph.
ExternalXfmd consumes NativeDocumentRendering.
functionality DiscoverSystemMembership.
NavigationProjection owns DiscoverSystemMembership.
DiscoverSystemMembership contributes-to ProducerOwnedNavigation.
functionality ProjectOrderedReadingTree.
NavigationProjection owns ProjectOrderedReadingTree.
ProjectOrderedReadingTree contributes-to ProducerOwnedNavigation.
functionality AdvertisePrimaryActivation.
NavigationProjection owns AdvertisePrimaryActivation.
AdvertisePrimaryActivation contributes-to ProducerOwnedNavigation.
functionality KeepExpansionSeparate.
NavigationProjection owns KeepExpansionSeparate.
KeepExpansionSeparate contributes-to ProducerOwnedNavigation.
functionality ProjectUnassignedSource.
NavigationProjection owns ProjectUnassignedSource.
ProjectUnassignedSource contributes-to ProducerOwnedNavigation.
functionality SelectSemanticCollections.
SdlSemanticLibrary owns SelectSemanticCollections.
SelectSemanticCollections contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality ComposeViewpointExplanation.
SdlSemanticLibrary owns ComposeViewpointExplanation.
ComposeViewpointExplanation contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality ComposeCollectionChapters.
SdlSemanticLibrary owns ComposeCollectionChapters.
ComposeCollectionChapters contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality ComposeObjectDetail.
SdlSemanticLibrary owns ComposeObjectDetail.
ComposeObjectDetail contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality SeparateCompleteRegisters.
SdlSemanticLibrary owns SeparateCompleteRegisters.
SeparateCompleteRegisters contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality ExplainChannelParticipants.
SdlSemanticLibrary owns ExplainChannelParticipants.
ExplainChannelParticipants contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality ResolveReadableStatements.
SdlSemanticLibrary owns ResolveReadableStatements.
ResolveReadableStatements contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality RetainCheckedSources.
DocumentPublisher owns RetainCheckedSources.
RetainCheckedSources contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality RejectStaleSelection.
DocumentPublisher owns RejectStaleSelection.
RejectStaleSelection contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality PublishOnDemandBundle.
DocumentPublisher owns PublishOnDemandBundle.
PublishOnDemandBundle contributes-to ReadableSystemDesign.
functionality ConsumeProducerTree.
ExternalXfmd owns ConsumeProducerTree.
ConsumeProducerTree contributes-to ProducerOwnedNavigation.
functionality ActivateOpaqueTarget.
ExternalXfmd owns ActivateOpaqueTarget.
ActivateOpaqueTarget contributes-to ProducerOwnedNavigation.
functionality RenderReturnedDocument.
ExternalXfmd owns RenderReturnedDocument.
RenderReturnedDocument contributes-to ProducerOwnedNavigation.
channel ReadingActions.
message SelectReadingNode.
message ReadingBundle.
contract ReadingActionContract.
ReadingActions upholds ReadingActionContract.
ReadingActionContract permits SelectReadingNode.
ReadingActionContract permits ReadingBundle.
SelectReadingNode has message-kind = request.
ReadingBundle has message-kind = result.
ReadingBundle replies-to SelectReadingNode.
ExternalXfmd uses ReadingActions as sender of SelectReadingNode in mode DesignBrowsing.
ExternalXfmd uses ReadingActions as receiver of ReadingBundle in mode DesignBrowsing.
DocumentPublisher uses ReadingActions as receiver of SelectReadingNode in mode DesignBrowsing.
DocumentPublisher uses ReadingActions as sender of ReadingBundle in mode DesignBrowsing.
scenario ReaderOpensCollection.
ReaderOpensCollection exercises UnderstandSystem.
ReaderOpensCollection runs-in DesignBrowsing.
ReaderOpensCollection step 1 sends SelectReadingNode from ExternalXfmd to DocumentPublisher via ReadingActions.
ReaderOpensCollection step 2 sends ReadingBundle from DocumentPublisher to ExternalXfmd via ReadingActions reply-to 1.
